  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Health of the Government of the Republic of Suriname - Suriname (01-Jan-2016-31-Dec-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suriname, TB/HIV, Ministry of Health of the Republic of Suriname (MOH)This program has the following goals: Improve the quality of life of PLWHIV.  Reduce incidence, mortality and transmission of TB.  Reduce new HIV infections. The objectives of this program are: Establish and strengthen joint TB-HIV management.  Expand high quality comprehensive HIV treatment, care and support.  Improve the quality of laboratory diagnosis.  Increase coverage of high quality DOTS.  Reduce HIV transmission among key and vulnerable populations</narrative>
  </description>
